# Azure Pull Request

Shared raw-name PR properties across created, updated, merge-attempt and PR-comment events. Repository and identity stay nested.

This is a JSON Schema socket contract, not an executable node. Use the matching
Decode / Encode nodes. Known optional properties preserve explicit null; absent
and null remain distinct. Unknown properties remain in the owning component or
EventConfig resource remainder, with no second complete event/resource copy.
Custom socket IDs and versions must match; publish dependent nodes with explicit
typeVersion pins. This schema uses local JSON Schema only, no global `$ref`.

